{
  "Document": [
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H1",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Getting Started with Leptos in Tauri"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "Leptos is a full-stack Rust framework that is uniquely suited for Tauri because it can be compiled to WebAssembly (WASM), allowing you to write your frontend logic in Rust."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H2",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Installation and Setup"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "To use Leptos in a Tauri project, you typically set up a CSR (Client-Side Rendering) project. This ensures that the Tauri webview can load the WASM binary and render the UI without needing a separate server."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H2",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "The WASM Pipeline"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "Your Rust code in the frontend is compiled using "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "wasm-pack"
        },
        {
          "Text": " or "
        },
        {
          "InlineCode": "trunk"
        },
        {
          "Text": ". Trunk is the most common tool for this, as it handles the HTML entry point, CSS bundling, and WASM compilation in one step."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Heading": {
        "level": "H2",
        "children": [
          {
            "Text": "Project Structure"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "Paragraph": [
        {
          "Text": "A typical Tauri + Leptos project looks like this:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "UnorderedList": [
        {
          "checked": null,
          "children": [
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "InlineCode": "src-tauri/"
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": The Rust backend (Tauri Core)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "InlineCode": "src/"
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": The Rust frontend (Leptos components)."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Paragraph": [
                {
                  "InlineCode": "index.html"
                },
                {
                  "Text": ": The entry point for the webview."
                }
              ]
            }
